Article 3 (Contents of Agreements between Industry and Academia)
The term "matters prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of SMEs and Startups" in Article 6 (1) of the Decree means the following matters: [Amended on June 2, 2006; March 23, 2013; and July 26, 2017.]
1. The parties to the agreement;
2. Plans for implementing industry-academia cooperation projects under the subparagraphs of Article 8 (1) of the Special Act on Support for Human Resources of Small and Medium Enterprises;
3. Allocation of financial resources for the projects;
4. Matters concerning amendments to the agreement;
5. Other matters that the Minister of SMEs and Startups deems necessary for the smooth implementation of the agreement between industry and academia.
